    "description": "ChatPlus Co.,Ltd. develops and provides SaaS-based subscription-based chatbot systems in Japan. The chatbot system is a service that supports companies in improving operational efficiency and productivity by automating and reducing the manpower required to handle inquiries from both inside and outside the company. It offers ChatPlus, a chatbot that supports the automation of corporate inquiry handling and communication, employing a format; AI Agent Plus, a chatbot that integrates generation AI such as ChatCPT with Chat Plus to generate optimal responses on the spot in addition to registered answers, enabling it to handle complex inquiries and diverse expressions from visitors and provide natural conversational responses; and FAQPlus, a system for creating, organizing, and managing articles of frequently asked questions and answers, so that users can easily find the answers they need. The company was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Chiyoda, Japan."
